# HireMatch.AI

> Know exactly why you're not getting interviews.

HireMatch.AI is an AI-powered job application screener that analyses your resume against any job description, scores your match, identifies keyword gaps, rewrites your bullet points, generates a tailored cover letter, and tracks every application in one dashboard.

## 🚀 Live Demo
**[hirematch-ai.vercel.app](https://hirematch-ai.vercel.app)**

## ✨ Features

- **Match Score** — AI scores your resume against the job description (0–100%)
- **Keyword Gap Analysis** — See exactly which keywords are missing from your resume
- **Skill Alignment** — Visual bars showing how well each skill area matches
- **Resume Rewriter** — Paste any bullet point, get an ATS-optimised rewrite for that specific job
- **Cover Letter Generator** — AI-generated cover letter tailored to the role
- **Application Tracker** — Every analysis saved to your personal dashboard
- **Job Search Intelligence** — Patterns across all your applications: which keywords keep blocking you, your interview conversion rate, and more

## 🛠 Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | HTML, CSS, JavaScript |
| AI | Google Gemini 2.0 Flash API |
| Backend | Vercel Serverless Functions |
| Database & Auth | Supabase (PostgreSQL + Row Level Security) |
| Deployment | Vercel |

## 📁 Project Structure

```
hirematch-ai/
├── api/
│   └── analyze.js      # Serverless function — Gemini API proxy
├── index.html          # Auth page (sign in / sign up)
├── app.html            # Main analyser
└── tracker.html        # Application tracker dashboard
```

## ⚙️ Setup

### 1. Supabase
1. Create a project at [supabase.com](https://supabase.com)
2. Run the schema from `supabase-setup.sql` in the SQL Editor
3. Copy your **Project URL** and **anon public key**

### 2. Gemini API
1. Get a free API key at [aistudio.google.com](https://aistudio.google.com)

### 3. Environment Variables (Vercel)
```
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
```

Add your Supabase credentials directly in the HTML files:
```js
const SUPABASE_URL = 'your-project-url';
const SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = 'your-anon-key';
```

### 4. Deploy
```bash
# Push to GitHub → Vercel auto-deploys
git push origin main
```

